(text "IN100 insect tag v7: 7 mm round tag, wire antenna, cut-to-start tail, any 1.4-1.55 V button cell" (at 25.4 167.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 04a5c440-b239-4357-a326-9a9e33f82855))
(text "- U1 IN100 QFN18 (JLC C6062024). VDDQ tied to VCC; unused GPIOs, switches and RTC pins left open; 4 vias in the EP." (at 25.4 170.434 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3229b64d-54ba-4392-86dc-2cd2fa48347a))
(text "- C1 47 uF 0603 carries the TX bursts a high-resistance button cell cannot; C4 at the VCC pin (SparkFun: 100 nF + 10 uF)." (at 25.4 173.228 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d0de492b-1e39-4f9f-9fb7-9796cdf39c42))
(text "- CHIP_EN: R1 pull-up and C2 delay on the tag (EN rises after VCC). JP1 (OFF) on the tail, bridged after" (at 25.4 176.022 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ee01fdc6-8f1f-49c5-b0d0-ad9f0f67fe04))
(text "  programming, holds EN low; cutting the tail starts the tag. Program 0 dBm or less, 1 Mbps PHY." (at 25.4 178.816 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a86061ad-678e-476e-bb97-b96412de99e5))
(text "- Variants (population only): A 1M/10nF/100nF  B C4=22uF  C R1=100k C2=100nF  D R1=10M  E = B + C." (at 25.4 181.61 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a6843b61-5e77-46de-a2fd-7c56730c3adf))
(text "- Y1 26 MHz 1612, 7 pF, 80 ohm ESR (IN100: 6-8 pF, <= 100 ohm): on-chip load capacitance, no external caps." (at 25.4 184.404 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 90e4e8b5-1f7e-4008-9677-7c9357dbeeda))
(text "- AE1: ~30 mm enamelled wire fed straight from RF_TX (on-chip 50 ohm match). AE2: optional GND counterpoise wire." (at 25.4 187.198 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 83cc3b9a-2524-4209-982a-d734a3a296af))
(text "- BT1: button cell under the tag: - cap silver-epoxied to the underside pad, + wire from the top rim pad." (at 25.4 189.992 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5693addb-c757-4307-b6c9-3f6b6e26b64e))
(text "Derived from the IN100 datasheet and SparkFun's NanoBeacon boards (CC BY-SA 4.0)." (at 25.4 192.786 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 19b2460b-c22f-409f-885d-364e7822f336))
